[statement]
Packages whose `install_if` conditions one package completes are walked
after it in the order apk's table of names holds their names, not the
order of names or records: the table's buckets in ascending order, a
name's bucket being its 32-bit MurmurHash3 with seed 5381, modulo 20,000.
`c` is in bucket 7,966, `a` in 12,779, and `b` in 18,296.

[repository]
P:base
V:1

P:a
V:1
i:base

P:b
V:1
i:base

P:c
V:1
i:base

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install c 1
install a 1
install b 1
